# Normalise all text to LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# The tree previously held a mix of CRLF and LF, which turned any edit made by
# a tool that rewrites a whole file into a diff spanning every line. Pinning
# eol=lf (rather than leaving it native) keeps the working tree consistent on
# Windows checkouts too, so the mix cannot reappear.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled shaders and other assets are binary; never touch their bytes.
*.spv binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.bin binary
